<title>THAILAND: Kiatnakin Finance to issue debentures.</title>
<headline>Kiatnakin Finance to issue debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kiatnakin Finance and Securities Plc said it would issue up to six billion baht worth of unsecured debentures through a private placement and/or to foreign investors.</p>
<p>The company said in a release to the Stock Exchange of Thailand the debentures would have a maturity of not more than seven years.</p>
<p>Other details of the issue have yet to be determined by the board of directors, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
